# INVWINQC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: one entry of
# each group of the Record menu at level 3, chosen by ALT-C and its
# letter, doing what its key does.  Open shows item 1 in view mode and
# Edit in edit mode, each closed by ESC.  Next order steps the item
# list's order, which no key does: the frame's title names each order.
# With a loan added at item 1, Items > Loans and holds shows the open
# rows, and Next list and CTRL-PGDN in turn step through the next views,
# each titled; CTRL-TAB and SHIFT-TAB change nothing, and CTRL-PGUP steps
# back.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINQC.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-C O
S OPENED
K ESC ALT-C E
S EDITED
K ESC
S LIST
# Next order: each step moves on by one order
K ALT-C R
S ORDER2
K ALT-C R
S ORDER3
K ALT-C R
S ORDER4
K ALT-C R
S ORDER1
# a loan at item 1, past due
K ALT-C A INS
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
K ESC ALT-I O
S OPEN
K ALT-C S
S NEXT1
K CPGDN
S TAB1
K ALT-C S
S NEXT2
K CTRL-TAB
S CTRLTAB
K SHIFT-TAB
S STAB
K CPGDN
S TAB2
K CPGUP
S PREV
K ESC ALT-F X
